---
layout: base.njk
title: 首页
permalink: /
---
<div class="wrap landing">
  <header class="landing-intro">
    <p class="landing-kicker">日子与思考</p>
    <h1>在这里，记录生活，<br>也留下一些想法。</h1>
    <p class="landing-description">一些发生的事，一些慢慢想明白的事。</p>
    {% if site.home.start %}
    <p class="landing-meta">始于 <time>{{ site.home.start }}</time><span>最近更新于 <time>{{ site.home.latest }}</time></span></p>
    {% endif %}
    <div class="landing-links"><a href="{{ base }}/today/">看看今日 →</a><a href="{{ base }}/month/{{ site.thisMonth }}/">按月翻阅 →</a></div>
  </header>

  <section aria-labelledby="thought-heading" class="landing-section">
    <div class="landing-section-head"><h2 id="thought-heading">随手翻翻</h2><button id="shuffle-thoughts" type="button" hidden>换几条 ↻</button></div>
    <div id="thought-list" class="landing-thoughts" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">
      {% for e in site.home.thoughts %}{% if loop.index <= 3 %}{% include "home-thought.njk" %}{% endif %}{% else %}<p class="empty">这里是空的。</p>{% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div id="thought-pool" hidden>{% for e in site.home.thoughts %}<template>{% include "home-thought.njk" %}</template>{% endfor %}</div>
  </section>

  <div class="landing-bottom">
    <section aria-labelledby="recent-heading" class="landing-section">
      <div class="landing-section-head"><h2 id="recent-heading">最近在做</h2><a href="{{ base }}/month/{{ site.thisMonth }}/">月视图 →</a></div>
      {% for e in site.home.recent %}
      <article class="landing-event"><p class="landing-meta">{{ e.date }} · <a href="{{ e.collectionUrl }}">{{ e.collectionName }}</a></p><h3><a href="{{ e.url }}">{{ e.title }}</a></h3><p class="landing-event-excerpt">{{ e.body | homeText | truncate(100) }}</p></article>
      {% else %}<p class="empty">这里是空的。</p>{% endfor %}
    </section>
    <aside class="landing-section" aria-labelledby="interests-heading">
      <div class="landing-section-head"><h2 id="interests-heading">关注的内容</h2></div>
      <div class="landing-collections">{% for c in site.collections %}{% if not c.isDefault %}<a href="{{ c.url }}">{{ c.name }} <span>→</span></a>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>
      <div class="landing-tags">{% for t in site.tags %}<a class="tag" href="{{ t.url }}"># {{ t.name }}</a>{% endfor %}</div>
      <a class="landing-read" href="{{ base }}/stats/">看看记录的积累 →</a>
    </aside>
  </div>
</div>
<script type="module" src="{{ base }}/assets/home.js"></script>
